#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-ical-import-export.php:90
msgid ""
"If selected, events that have the same description will be grouped into one "
"event spaning over multiple days."
msgstr ""
"Si se selecciona, los eventos que tienen la misma descripción se agruparán "
"en un evento que abarcará varios días."

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-ical-import-export.php:365
msgid ""
"If selected, the start and end dates of the iCalendar Events will be "
"displayed as Split Days. You will have to chose the legends to be used below."
msgstr ""
"Si se selecciona, las fechas de inicio y finalización de los eventos de "
"iCalendar se mostrarán como días divididos. Deberá elegir las leyendas que "
"se utilizarán a continuación."

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-calendar.php:185
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/SingleCalendar/SingleCalendar.php:208
msgid ""
"If set to yes and if the calendar displays multiple months, when the user "
"uses the arrows to navigate the calendar, the calendar will switch the "
"number of months selected, rather than just one month."
msgstr ""
"Si se establece en sí y si el calendario muestra varios meses, cuando el "
"usuario usa las flechas para navegar por el calendario, el calendario "
"cambiará la cantidad de meses seleccionados, en lugar de solo un mes."

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-overview-calendar.php:147
msgid ""
"If set to yes, it will display a secondary calendar header for the dates "
"(besides the day numbers), containing the first letter of the day's name. "
"For example, Monday will display M."
msgstr ""
"Si se establece en sí, mostrará un encabezado de calendario secundario para "
"las fechas (además de los números de día), que contiene la primera letra del "
"nombre del día. Por ejemplo, el lunes mostrará M."

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-calendar.php:240
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/SingleCalendar/SingleCalendar.php:250
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/OverviewCalendar/OverviewCalendar.php:117
msgid ""
"If set to yes, it will display at the beginning of each week the week's "
"number counted from the beginning of the year."
msgstr ""
"Si se establece en sí, se mostrará al comienzo de cada semana el número de "
"la semana contada desde el comienzo del año."

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-calendar.php:173
#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-yearly-calendar.php:114
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/YearlyCalendar/YearlyCalendar.php:133
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/SingleCalendar/SingleCalendar.php:199
msgid ""
"If set to yes, the calendar will display a month and year drop-down select "
"field as a navigation alternative to the arrows."
msgstr ""
"Si se establece en sí, el calendario mostrará un campo de selección "
"desplegable de mes y año como una alternativa de navegación a las flechas."

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-calendar.php:424
#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-yearly-calendar.php:325
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/YearlyCalendar/YearlyCalendar.php:253
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/SingleCalendar/SingleCalendar.php:337
msgid ""
"If set to yes, the dates selected in the calendar will appear in the form as "
"well. This just provides a visual confirmation of the dates selected."
msgstr ""
"Si se establece en sí, las fechas seleccionadas en el calendario también "
"aparecerán en el formulario. Esto solo proporciona una confirmación visual "
"de las fechas seleccionadas."

#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/YearlyCalendar/YearlyCalendar.php:175
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/SingleCalendar/SingleCalendar.php:259
msgid "If set to yes, the price will be displayed below each calendar date."
msgstr ""
"Si se establece en sí, el precio se mostrará debajo de cada fecha del "
"calendario."

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-calendar.php:322
#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-shortcode-generator-insert-yearly-calendar.php:223
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/YearlyCalendar/YearlyCalendar.php:192
#: includes/modules/divi/includes/modules/SingleCalendar/SingleCalendar.php:276
msgid ""
"If set to yes, when a booking is made, the dates in the calendar will "
"automatically be changed to the 'Booked' legend"
msgstr ""
"Si se establece en sí, cuando se realiza una reserva, las fechas en el "
"calendario se cambiarán automáticamente a la leyenda 'Reservado'"

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/views/view-edit-calendar.php:435
msgid ""
"If this box is ticked, the empty fields in the bulk editor will be ignored "
"and will not clear existing data from the calendar."
