#: includes/modules/pricing/settings/views/view-payment-settings-bank-transfer.php:90
#: includes/modules/pricing/form/views/view-edit-form-tab-payment-options.php:110
msgid ""
"You can use the <span class=\"wpbs-small-print-tag wpbs-select-on-click\">"
"{Amount}</span> tag to show the total amount needed to be paid by the "
"customer, or the <span class=\"wpbs-small-print-tag wpbs-select-on-click\">"
"{Booking ID}</span> tag to add a transaction reference number."
msgstr ""
"Puede usar la <span class=\"wpbs-small-print-tag wpbs-select-on-click\">"
"etiqueta {Amount}</span> para mostrar la cantidad total que debe pagar el "
"cliente, o la <span class=\"wpbs-small-print-tag wpbs-select-on-click\">"
"etiqueta {Booking ID}</span> para agregar un número de referencia de "
"transacción."

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-settings-tab-form.php:91
msgid ""
"You can use the automatic country location feature by using looking up the "
"customer's IP address. Sign up for a free API key on <a href='https://ipinfo."
"io' target='_blank'>https://ipinfo.io</a>."
msgstr ""

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/class-calendar-editor-outputter.php:269
msgid ""
"You can use the description field of the date to add private information "
"regarding your booking. This information will not be displayed publicly on "
"the website, but it will be used as the event description when exporting "
"iCalendar events."
msgstr ""

#: includes/base/admin/calendar/class-calendar-editor-outputter.php:270
msgid ""
"You can use the tooltip field of the date to add information that you wish "
"users to see when they hover over the calendar date in the front-end part of "
"your website."
msgstr ""
"Puede usar el campo de tooltip de la fecha para agregar la información que "
"desea que los usuarios vean cuando coloquen el cursor sobre la fecha del "
"calendario en la parte frontal de su sitio web."

#: includes/base/admin/form/views/view-edit-form-tab-user-notification.php:44
#: includes/base/admin/form/views/view-edit-form-tab-admin-notification.php:32
#: includes/modules/pricing/form/views/view-edit-form-tab-final-payment-success.php:58
#: includes/modules/pricing/form/views/view-edit-form-tab-final-payment-reminder.php:58
msgid ""
"You can use these dynamic tags in any of the fields. They will be replaced "
"with the values submitted in the form."
msgstr ""
"Puede utilizar estas etiquetas dinámicas en cualquiera de los campos. Serán "
"reemplazados por los valores enviados en el formulario."

#: includes/base/admin/form/views/view-edit-form-tab-general-options.php:4
msgid ""
"You can use these dynamic tags in the Event Description and Event Tooltip "
"fields. They will be replaced with the values submitted in the form."
msgstr ""
"Puede utilizar estas etiquetas dinámicas en los campos Descripción del "
"evento y Tooltip del evento. Serán reemplazados por los valores enviados en "
"el formulario."

